# Swamp Swap
===
**Swamp Swap** is a GUI wrapper for a terminal application called **croc**. croc allows users to easily and securely transfer files between one another. The intention of Swamp Swap is to be a fun and simple-to-use interface for users that prefer a graphical user interface over terminal input.

croc was created by Zack Schollz
